<title>SWEDEN: Stora to invest 400-450 mln Skr in board.</title>
<headline>Stora to invest 400-450 mln Skr in board.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry group Stora AB said on Wednesday it will invest 400-450 million crowns in improving a paper board machine at its Stora Fors plant in Sweden, boosting its capacity.</p>
<p>The investment will boost the plant's annual capacity by 20-25,000 tonnes to a total of 300,000-305,000, Carl-Erik Backstrom, president of Stora Fors, told Reuters.</p>
<p>The project, which mainly will be carried out in 1998, will raise quality and is part of Stora's strategy to streamline and focus its production units.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
